  "notes": "The zone constraint permits parallel work of robots of the same type within a zone (different robot types must be sequenced). With this interpretation, Z1’s excavation (two excavators in parallel), compaction (two compactors in parallel) and survey can be scheduled as: excavation 0‑21 h, compaction 21‑35 h, survey 35‑40 h, giving a Z1 makespan of 40 h. Z2’s haul (two haulers in parallel) 21‑33 h and compaction (two compactors in parallel) 33‑39 h yields a Z2 makespan of 39 h. Overall makespan 40 h < horizon 60 h, and the berm‑haul‑after‑excavation constraint is satisfied via the after edges T3,T4 after T1,T2. Thus all conflicts are resolved."
 },
